to use the website and any service at your sole risk and that to the fullest extent permitted under website applicable law, glimmergowns and its affiliates shall have no liability to you for content that may be deemed offensive, indecent, or objectionable to you.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">glimmergowns through its website intends to provide its users with general information about beauty and healthcare topics and products. The website encourages its Users to interact with glimmergowns and its employees by asking questions that enables the user to obtain information of a general nature pertaining to beauty and healthcare topics. The postings on the website or on social networking websites, including the website\'s Facebook page, or any information provided over chat or e-mails exchanged with glimmergowns, its employees or representatives (collectively referred to as \"Information\") which are in furtherance of any communication made by the user with glimmergowns, its employees or representatives is based on the background provided by the user. The Information is not intended to constitute personal medical advice or be used for any medical diagnosis or treatment. While glimmergowns takes reasonable care to ensure that the Information is accurate, glimmergowns takes no responsibility for the accuracy, completeness, website appropriateness or usefulness of the Information. For any specific medical conditions or issues, Users are advised to seek opinion from a certified medical practitioner. In case any User relies on the Information, he/she may do so at his or her own risk. Under no circumstances will glimmergowns , its employees, representative or affiliates be liable for the Information or the consequences of relying on such Information.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">For any general information posted on the website, users must not infer or assume that such information necessarily relates to them.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">In keeping with glimmergowns’ objective of providing its users with general information about beauty and healthcare topics and products, glimmergowns engages experts having knowledge in their respective fields (\"Experts\") to respond to queries posted by users. Any information provided by the Experts, either over the website, through e-mails, chat rooms or on social networking websites, including the website\'s Facebook page (collectively referred to as \"Expert\'s Opinion\") is based on the Expert\'s personal opinion. The Expert\'s Opinion is not intended to constitute personal medical advice or be used for any medical diagnosis or treatment. glimmergowns takes no responsibility for the accuracy, completeness, website appropriateness or usefulness of the Expert\'s Opinion. In case any user relies on such Expert\'s Opinion, he/she may do so at his or her own risk. Under no circumstances will the Company, its employees, representative or affiliates be liable for such Expert\'s Opinion or for the consequences of relying on such Expert\'s Opinion.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">This disclaimer constitutes an essential part of this Terms of Use.</p><h1 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(6,6,6);font-size:25px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;line-height:normal;margin:20px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">WEBSITE SECURITY</h1><p styl