limitation browsers, spiders, robots, avatars or intelligent agents) to navigate or search this website other than the search engine and search agents available from glimmergowns on this website and other than generally available third party web browsers (e.g., Netscape Navigator, Microsoft Explorer).</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">The Users are also expressly prohibited in doing the following:</p><ol style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:0px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\" type=\"a\"><li>Use of any \"deep-link\",\"page-scrape\", \"robot\", \"spider\" or other automatic device, program, or any similar or equivalent manual process, to access or monitor any portion of the Website/Application or any Content;</li><li>To duplicate, reproduce, sell, resell or transfer proprietary information or material which are available on the Website.</li><li>Copy, distribute and indulge in plagiarism with website content;</li><li>Make any unauthorized use of Website/Application in any manner which is inconsistent with any applicable laws or regulations including but not limited to the Information Technology Act, 2000;</li><li>Impersonate or falsely represent yourself with any person or entity or any other user and interfering in their use of Website;</li><li>Attempt to hack, reverse engineer or edit HTML source code;</li><li>Systematically retrieve data or other content from our Website or Services to create or compile, directly or indirectly, in single or multiple downloads, a compilation, database, directory or the like, whether by manual methods, through the use of automated devices, or otherwise;</li></ol><h1 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(6,6,6);font-size:25px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;line-height:normal;margin:20px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS</h1><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">glimmergowns name and logo are a trademark of glimmergowns. The use of the website does not in any way grant any license or right to use of the said trademark to any person. Further, the trademarks and logos of the brands displayed on the website are the intellectual property of the respective companies and glimmergowns shall not be liable for any infringement of such intellectual property by any user.</p><h1 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(6,6,6);font-size:25px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;line-height:normal;margin:20px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">SEVERABILITY:</h1><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">Should any part of this Terms of Use be held invalid or unenforceable, that portion shall be construed consistent with applicable law and the remaining portions shall remain in full force and effect.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">Waiver: Our failure to enforce any provision shall not be deemed a waiver of such provision nor of the right to enforce such provision.</p><h1 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(6,6,6);font-size:25px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;line-height:normal;margin:20px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">FORCE MAJEURE:</h1><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">We shall have no liability to the user for the matters where it is beyond our control including but not limited to Act of God, War, Black-outs, curfews, Orders of the Government etc.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">If any part of these Terms of Use is determined to be invalid or unenforceable pursuant to website applicable law including, but not limited to, the warranty disclaimers and liability limitations set forth above, then the invalid or unenforceable provision will be deemed to be superseded by a valid, enforceable provision that most closely matches the intent of the original provision and the remainder of the Terms of Use shall continue to be in effect. Unless otherwise specified herein, these Terms of Use constitutes the entire agreement between you and glimmergowns with respect to the website/services and it supersedes all prior or contemporaneous communications and proposals, whether electronic, oral or written.</p><h1 style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(6,6,6);font-size:25px;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;line-height:normal;margin:20px 0px 10px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">CONTACT INFORMATION:</h1><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:1.9em;margin:0px 0px 25px;text-align:justify;word-spacing:0px;\">E-mail id: &nbsp;admin@glimmergowns.com</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Terms and Conditions For Order Placement</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>1. Order Processing and Payment Confirmation</strong></span></p><p>- All orders placed through our website will only be processed upon successful payment confirmation.<br>- Until payment is confirmed, the order will remain in a pending state and will not proceed to the next stage of processing.<br>- Payment confirmation is a mandatory prerequisite for the processing and fulfillment of your order.<br>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>2. Payment Issues and Customer Assistance&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(85,88,91);font-family:Jost, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:26px;margin:0px 0px 15px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\">- In the event that your payment is successfully completed but your order is not confirmed within a reasonable time frame, please contact us immediately.<br>- To expedite the resolution, kindly provide proof of payment, such as a transaction receipt, payment confirmation email, or screenshot.<br>- You can send the payment proof to the designated email address provided on our website or contact our support team via the phone number listed on our website.</p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(85,88,91);font-family:Jost, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;line-height:26px;margin:0px 0px 15px;padding:0px;word-spacing:0px;\"><br>By placing an order with us, you agree to these terms and conditions regarding payment and order confirmation. We appreciate your cooperation and are committed to resolving any issues promptly.</p>', 1, NULL, 'default', 'Read the terms and conditions of GlimmerGowns to understand our policies regarding shopping, returns, and usage of our women\'s fashion products. Stay informed about your rights and responsibilities when using our services.', 'published', '2024-06-24 13:50:22', '2025-10-09 02:46:26'),
(14, 'Refund and Cancellations', '<p>Refund and Cancellations Policy for our company <img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:209/12;width:14%;\" src=\"https://glimmergowns.com/storage/glimmergowns/cpny1.png\" alt=\"cpny1\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"209\" height=\"12\"> as follows:-</p><p>Cancellation before shipment: If the order or the item(s) that you want to cancel have not been shipped yet, you can write to our customer support team.<br>In such cases, the order will be cancelled, and the money will be refunded to you within 24-48 business hours after the cancellation request is duly processed by us. In case of cancellation before shipment, we process the refund within business hours after receiving the cancellation request.</p><p>In case of cancellation once the shipment has already been dispatched or if it is being returned, we process the refund once the products have been received and verified.<br>For payments done through credit/debit cards or net banking, the refund will be processed to the same account from which the payment was made within 24-48 business hours of us receiving the products back. It may take 2-3 additional business days for the amount to reflect in your account.<br>loompure.com offers its customers an ’Easy return policy, wherein you can raise a return/exchange request of a product within 7 days of its delivery. We also accept partial returns wherein you can raise a return request for one or all products in your order.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Contact our Customer Support team via email within 5 business days of receiving the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Provide us with your order ID details and your request to return/replace/refund your order. Kindly email an image of the product and the invoice for our reference.<br>If a return is loompure.com. online will replace or refund the invoiced rupee value for, the damaged / defective/expired/wrong product. In either case, the additional customs amount paid by the customer to receive the product will be reimbursed to the customer in the form of a refund coupon, that can be applied to the customer’s next order with loompure.com, subject to the customer providing a copy of the customs receipt</p><p><br><strong>Note</strong>: If it is a case of replacement, it is subject to the availability of stock. In cases when a replacement may not be available, we will refund you the full amount. Returns will not be accepted under the following conditions: Product is damaged due to misuse/overuse<br>&nbsp;Returned without original packaging including, price tags, labels, and other accessories Serial Number is tampered with.<br>&nbsp;Defective products that are not covered under Seller/Manufacturer’s warranty<br>Product is used or altered<br>If a request is initiated after 5 business days of order delivery<br>&nbsp;Free product provided by the brand<br>Our shipments go through rigorous quality check processes before they leave our warehouse. However, in the rare case that your product is damaged during shipment or transit, you can request for a replacement or cancellation and refund.<br>If you have received an item in a damaged/defective condition or have been sent a wrong product, you can follow a few simple steps to initiate your return/refund within 5 days of receiving the order:</p><p><br><strong>Step 1</strong>: Contact our Customer Support team via email within 5 business days of receiving the order.</p><p><strong>Step 2</strong>: Provide us with your order ID details and your request to return/replace/refund the defective/wrong items in your order. Kindly share an image of the product and the invoice for our reference.</p><p><strong>Step 3</strong>: We will pick up the products within 2-4 business days. We will initiate the refund or replacement process only if the products are received by us in their original packaging with their seals, labels, and barcodes intact.</p><p><strong>Note</strong>: If it is a case of replacement, it is subject to the availability of stock. In case that a replacement may not be available, we will refund you the full amount.<br>&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, 'default', 'Learn about our refund and cancellations policy at GlimmerGowns. Find out how we handle returns and cancellations for your purchases of women\'s fashion items. Your satisfaction is our priority', 'published', '2024-06-24 13:59:27', '2025-10-09 02:32:46');
